============================================
Create Database and Schema
============================================
Script Purpose:
    This script creates a new database name 'Data_warehouse_project' after checking if it already exists.
    If the database exists' it will drop it and recreate another. Additionally, the script sets up three schemas 
    within the database: 'bronze, silver, gold'.

Warning:
    running this script will drop the entire 'data_warehouse_project' if it exists.
    all data in the database will be permanently deleted. Proceed with caution and 
    ensure you have proper backups before running this script.
